  help               Show this help

Environment overrides:
  DETRAN_STACK_STATE_DIR, DETRAN_STACK_HEALTH_TIMEOUT_SECONDS,
  DETRAN_DB_CONTAINER, DETRAN_DB_VOLUME, DB_PASSWORD, DETRAN_MOCK_PROJECT,
