This repository is the DETRAN consolidation monorepo. It is **DEVAI-governed**
(`@aarusso-nyx/devai@1.5.6`, Constitution 1.0.0 pinned at
`.devai/pin/constitution.md`; `.devai/` is the governance root) and built on the
